        "id": 127784,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-16T14:31:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My Wife's family are Slovaks fleeing the soviets, Irish escaping the famine and Germans who fought for the Brittish in the Revolution, then took their money and bought a farm in America. &nbsp;They are much more interesting than a bunch of Quakers whose claim to fame is being on a bunch of town's founding charters because they kept moving west to avoid the non-Quakers.</p>",
