        "id": 127786,
        "name": "Silverleaf",
        "username": "Silverleaf",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silverleaf/{size}/2332_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-16T14:47:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm desperate to find someone who went to prison, or got deported, or emigrated, or lived with a member of the same sex in a \"secret\" relationship, or something.</p><p>I started making one of those word cloud diagrams (you know, the ones where the size of the word indicates how frequently it appears in your list) of my direct ancestors' occupations, as collected from census data. I gave it up because the words</p><h2><strong>COAL MINER</strong></h2><p>were so big you that's all you could see (apart from sheep shear grinder and agricultural labourer which were still tiny in comparison).</p>",
