        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-16T17:21:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don't really know much about my family. I know my mum's parents spent a lot of time in India but they weren't actually Indian, I don't think. My dad's family goes back quite a way in the UK. He said somewhere back along the line was a bloke who operated Tower Bridge - as in, activated the controls to raise/lower it when ships were going through and stuff. And we've got a book about lepidoptra by someone on my dad's side which has notes in it in red pen, like it was an earlier version of the book and he was gonna get it reprinted or something.</p>",
