        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/da6949/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-17T06:20:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Reading you all debating about your family trees has me wanting to play the Sims 3 again.</p><p>My tree has only a few notable things.</p><p>A noble title was involved at some point in the past, the last one to wear it was a passionate swimmer who wrote books about natation, and was rumored to be able to sleep while swimming. It was a very distant branch of the family.</p><p>One of my great grand parents was the only of 17 children to not become a priest, monk or nun. He was known for his white beard that he milked (painted whiter with milk) every morning and his love of young female ballet dancers (no milking involved).</p><p>Also, witches and sorcerors.</p>",
